Package: fcitx-vinpst
Version: @VINPST_VERSION@-@VINPST_RELEASE@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @VINPST_ARCHITECTURE@
Maintainer: Vinpst Maintainers <maintainers@example.invalid>
Homepage: https://github.com/rijuyuezhu/fcitx-vinpst
Depends: bash, coreutils, dbus-user-session, fcitx5, libfontconfig1, libpipewire-0.3-0, libsystemd0, libwayland-client0, libx11-6, libxkbcommon0, procps, systemd
Recommends: wireplumber
Description: Rust voice-input addon and daemon for Fcitx 5
 The package contains the command-line management tool,
 D-Bus daemon, Rust/Iced management GUI, thin Fcitx 5 addon, activation
 metadata, translations, and checksum-pinned private native ASR runtime
 libraries.
